        {
          "type": "text",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "The Hygge Collection is a study of the balance of furniture and the elements that surround it. We at Albero believe that the warmth of humans, experiences, and memories are what bring life into furniture. The collection serves as a reminder to embrace aspects that make the experience of furniture whole. Presenting, the Hygge Collection."
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "The collection is a homage and reimagination of nature in its most organic form. Inspired by drawnness to nature, Hygge may be characterized as refined play of movement, light, color, and shape. The overall effect is peace and tranquility."
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "Hygge [ˈhykə] • The inexplicable feeling of contentment derived from a warm and cozy mood and atmosphere."
            }
          ]
        },
